        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we enhanced international wire transfers, ACH origination, and treasury management solutions, and developed the ability for clients to automatically enroll business accounts in online banking, download multiple digital statements, and electronically notify the bank of loan payment notice errors.",
